    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[A beautiful client for Plex & Jellyfin

Stream your media library with HDR, Dolby Vision, offline downloads, and a gorgeous experience across all your devices.

**Features**

- Wide Codec Support
- HDR10+
- Subtitles
- Cross-Platform
- Offline
- Watch Together
- Tracker Sync
- Skip intros
- Chapter support
- Gestures
]]></description>
    <summary>A modern client for Plex and Jellyfin on desktop, mobile, and TV. Built with Flutter for native performance and a clean interface.</summary>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[[Releases](https://github.com/edde746/plezy/releases)

## Playback

- Paused playback resumes after the Android screensaver
- AV1 plays without corrupt or black video on more Android devices
- Steadier frame pacing on Android
- TrueHD passthrough recovers after seeking

## Jellyfin & Emby

- Emby Live TV plays instead of failing to load
- Live TV tunes when a tuner takes longer to start
- Sessions report the platform in the client and device name

## Watch Together

- Relays with no port in their address connect

## Desktop

- Closing the app during playback ends the server session immediately]]></releaseNotes>
